{
 "summary": "Checkout failures are a timeout cascade that starts in inventory. Inventory 3.2.1 was deployed at 07:18:17Z. About 15–30s later inventory p95 latency rose to 4.77s while it still returned no 5xx. Orders then returned 504s (up to 100%), and the gateway returned 502s on POST /checkout (up to 71.8%). The most likely cause is a latency regression in inventory POST /reserve in release 3.2.1; consider rolling back inventory to 3.1.5.",
 "root_cause": {
  "statement": "Inventory release 3.2.1, deployed at 07:18:17Z, most likely introduced a latency regression in POST /reserve. Orders times out waiting on it and returns 504, which surfaces as gateway 502s on checkout. What links the deploy to the symptoms: latency and error onsets at 07:18:32–07:18:47 come 15–30s after the deploy, sampled failing traces put most self time in inventory POST /reserve on release 3.2.1, and inventory is slow but returns no errors itself, which fits a timeout cascade.",
  "service": "inventory",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "evidence_ids": [
   "ev-190058c637be",
   "ev-5fa58511a1e2",
   "ev-51525d7035d0",
   "ev-1da116a62fee",
   "ev-c000e6b4f684"
  ]
 },
 "contributing_factors": [
  {
   "statement": "Orders' timeout toward inventory appears to be about 2s. Failing traces end at 2.01–2.24s, while inventory p95 reaches 4.77s, so slow inventory calls become 504s instead of slow successes.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-5fa58511a1e2",
    "ev-51525d7035d0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "statement": "The gateway passes orders' 504s through to clients as 502s on POST /checkout.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-5fa58511a1e2",
    "ev-c000e6b4f684"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "timeline": [
  {
   "time": "2026-10-23T07:18:17Z",
   "event": "Inventory deployed, 3.1.5 -> 3.2.1, by ci-pipeline.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-190058c637be"
   ]
  },
  {
   "time": "2026-10-23T07:18:32Z",
   "event": "Orders 5xx ratio crosses 5% and p95 latency crosses 1s.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-1da116a62fee"
   ]
  },
  {
   "time": "2026-10-23T07:18:47Z",
   "event": "Inventory p95 crosses 1s with no 5xx. Gateway 5xx ratio crosses 5% and p95 crosses 1s.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-51525d7035d0",
    "ev-c000e6b4f684"
   ]
  },
  {
   "time": "2026-10-23T07:20:33Z",
